#ROOMS
#2419
The Training Yard~
A square of hard-packed earth beneath the great oak, south of the
entrance to the Hall of Heroes, walled on every side and with room in it
for one fighter at a time.  A dummy stands at the centre on a weighted
post, leaning slightly, sackcloth split and resewn along every seam.
Somebody has chalked a tally on the wall and given up counting.

Nothing dies here.  That is the whole point of the place.  North leads
back to the entrance hall, and HELP DUMMY explains everything the yard
can tell you.
~
0 LV 1
